{
  "format": "arsenal.stage-setups/v1",
  "about": "SETUPS (2026-10-29, setups.js): a palette x a PLACEMENT -- which colour goes on which part of the rig. They rotate on the 16-bar phrase lines (O / Shift+O by hand, landing on the next bar line; ?setup=<id> holds one, ?setups=hold holds, ?setups=off is the palettes' own looks). Kick 5's bank turns the colours WITHIN the setup. Daniel, 2026-10-29: \"in the screenshot the middle row being white with the other lights being blue and lasers flashing green or purple or pink, can you think of a few cool color palates using the screenshot as a reference for placement and ideas, we could also leverage gradients on the led cubes\" ... \"not permantly only orange and gold, i want the lights to cycle different color palates and setups\".",
  "rotate_bars": 16,
  "min_bars": 8,
  "fade_beats": 4,
  "order": [
    "ice-spine",
    "gold-sapphire",
    "neon-split",
    "aurora-column",
    "source-fan",
    "ember-cathedral",
    "cyan-crown",
    "black-and-one"
  ],
